Backport Copilot per-model reasoning effort discovery to the bundled CLI 0.2.20 package.

The released probe observes model-scoped ACP options only for the session's current model. The fork's canonical probe and Copilot catalog mark this provider as per-model; this patch adapts those behaviors to the compiled release chunks so the model picker sees each observed Copilot model's valid effort choices.

Apply from the extracted release root with patch -p1 --fuzz=0. The content-addressed chunk names and hunks are specific to cli-v0.2.20.

Adapted from the fork's apps/cli/src/capabilities/probes/agentModelsProbe.ts and packages/agents/src/models.ts.

